                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Is podcast marketing worth it for D2C?</h3>
                                        <p>For wellness + personal care + F&B + financial services + tech D2C: yes. Host-read format especially compounds trust. Longer payback window (3-6 months) requires patience.</p>
                                        <h3>Host-read or programmatic ads?</h3>
                                        <p>Host-read for trust-critical categories (wellness, personal care). Programmatic for volume + reach at lower cost. Combined stack often optimal.</p>
                                        <h3>Should D2C brands launch own podcasts?</h3>
                                        <p>For content-heavy positioning brands (Blue Tokai, Traya patterns): yes. Investment ₹15-45 lakh + payback 12-36 months but compounding equity.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the ROI of podcast marketing?</h3>
                                        <p>Hard to attribute directly. Best proxies: unique promo codes, brand-search lift post-campaign, listener-cohort tracking via CDP.</p>
